---
---
<header class="hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="hero-grid">
      <div class="inner">
        <h1>Your terminal workspace, tiled.</h1>
        <p class="tagline">A clean tiling terminal host and scriptable CLI for macOS, Linux, and Windows. Use subcontexts, status hooks, Quick Note, and local apps without leaving the workspace.</p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a class="btn lg" href="/download">Download alpha <span class="arrow">→</span></a>
          <a class="text-link" href="/docs">Read the docs</a>
        </div>
        <div class="meta-under">macOS · Linux · Windows · open source · local-first</div>
      </div>

      <div class="preview-stage" aria-label="Plexi product screenshot">
        <div class="preview-halo">
          <div class="preview-frame">
            <div class="preview-titlebar">
              <span></span><span></span><span></span>
              <strong>workspace</strong>
              <em>terminal + app panes</em>
            </div>
            <img src="/screenshot-4.png" alt="Plexi with tiled terminal and app panes" class="preview-screenshot" />
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>
